Name":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":2}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-white","children":"Open the channels you actually watch"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300","children":"Not the impressive-sounding ones. Go to the handful your household turns on every week. A large channel count is meaningless if your five favourites are unreliable."}]]}],["$","article","Check the programme guide",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":3}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-white","children":"Check the programme guide"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300","children":"Does the EPG load, is it accurate, and does it match what is actually playing? A guide that is empty or wrong makes live television frustrating to navigate."}]]}],["$","article","Test channel switching",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-xs font-bold text-white","children":4}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base font-bold text-white","children":"Test channel switching"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300","children":"Flick between several channels in a row. Slow switching is one of the most common day-to-day annoyances and you will only notice it by doing it."}]]}],["$","article","Try a film as well as live TV",{"className":"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500 text-xs font-bold text-white","childre